# 仅保留预处理脚本（供学习），原始数据与中间结果体积过大，不纳入仓库。
# Only the preprocessing scripts are tracked (for learning). Raw / intermediate
# data files are excluded because they are too large for GitHub.

# 默认忽略一切 / ignore everything by default
*

# 但保留目录结构与脚本 / but keep directory structure and scripts
!*/
!*.py
!*.md
!.gitignore

# 始终排除 IDE 配置 / always exclude IDE configs
.idea/
